  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "How a finding is judged",
      "items": [
        "A finding carries severity (blocker · warn · nit), a lens, and a summary; section, line and fix are optional",
        "Findings are authored by the review round only — the fix round consumes them and never authors a verdict",
        "The review never declares a status — the engine rolls it up: blocker → CHANGES_REQUESTED · warn/nit → REVIEW_FIX · none → APPROVED",
        "Calibrate by real severity — not everything is a blocker; the reviewed artifact is a vision, so its silence is not permission",
        "List every behavior set aside as out of scope, one line each; acknowledge what was done well before the findings"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Lens by review type",
      "items": [
        "wave / branch — standards · spec · buildability; a buildability finding self-reports the typecheck AND test evidence",
        "spec — completeness · consistency · clarity; program conformance + a colocated pin for every claim",
        "plan — completeness · decomposition · buildability; spec conformance + a colocated pin for every claim",
        "The branch review adds design, test adequacy and migration to the same axes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One-way fix, one closure",
      "items": [
        "The review round’s findings decide the route: any finding → fix; zero findings → close now",
        "Fix consumes the review’s findings; it never authors a verdict of its own",
        "After fix: a source review with blocker > 0 → re-review; blocker = 0 with warn/nit → REVIEW_FIX closure",
        "The re-review repeats the same rule until closure; 20 consecutive blocker cycles → soft cap"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The next: contract",
      "items": [
        "The engine's next: line is the only continuation; a BLOCKED or TIMEOUT round carries none",
        "Closure is next-wave (ready tasks) while the batch has work, done when the run is exhausted",
        "Pipeline handoff: phase-spec → cdd-plan · plan → cdd-dev · wave → review --type branch · branch → cdd-close · overall → done"
      ]
    }
  ]
